<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <title>Apex &mdash; Admin</title>
  <link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.3/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css" rel="stylesheet">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/app.css">
</head>
<body>
  <%- include('partials/header', { user }) %>
  <div class="container">
    <p><a href="/repos">&larr; Back to repositories</a></p>
    <h1 class="mb-4">Access administration</h1>

    <div id="admin-error" class="alert alert-danger d-none"></div>
    <div id="admin-success" class="alert alert-success d-none"></div>

    <h2 class="h4">Users</h2>
    <p class="text-muted">Edit a user's initials (used to name their branches, e.g. <code>dev/{initials}-{CO}-{n}</code>).</p>
    <table class="table table-hover align-middle">
      <thead>
        <tr>
          <th>Username</th>
          <th>Initials</th>
          <th>Admin</th>
          <th></th>
        </tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody id="user-rows">
        <tr><td colspan="4" class="text-muted">Loading&hellip;</td></tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>

    <h2 class="h4 mt-5">Grant repo-group access</h2>
    <div class="row g-2 mb-3">
      <div class="col-md-4">
        <label for="grant-user-select" class="form-label">User</label>
        <select id="grant-user-select" class="form-select">
          <option value="">Loading&hellip;</option>
        </select>
      </div>
      <div class="col-md-4">
        <label for="grant-repo-group-select" class="form-label">Repo group</label>
        <select id="grant-repo-group-select" class="form-select">
          <option value="">Loading&hellip;</option>
        </select>
      </div>
      <div class="col-md-2 align-self-end">
        <button id="grant-btn" type="button" class="btn btn-primary w-100">Grant</button>
      </div>
    </div>

    <h2 class="h4 mt-5">Current access</h2>
    <table class="table table-hover align-middle">
      <thead>
        <tr>
          <th>User</th>
          <th>Org</th>
          <th>Repo group</th>
          <th>Granted</th>
          <th></th>
        </tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody id="permission-rows">
        <tr><td colspan="5" class="text-muted">Loading&hellip;</td></tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>

    <h2 class="h4 mt-5">Blocked-allowlist alerts</h2>
    <p class="text-muted">GitHub write calls (branch creation or a pipeline
      push) that came back HTTP 403 - the status GitHub surfaces both for an
      App-permission scope violation and for the <code>dev/**</code>
      ruleset rejecting a ref outside the allowed pattern. See
      <code>docs/human-judgment-reliance.md</code> for why this is
      classified and surfaced rather than auto-resolved.</p>
    <table class="table table-hover align-middle">
      <thead>
        <tr>
          <th>Repo</th>
          <th>CO</th>
          <th>Branch</th>
          <th>Operation</th>
          <th>HTTP status</th>
          <th>When</th>
        </tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody id="alert-rows">
        <tr><td colspan="6" class="text-muted">Loading&hellip;</td></tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>

    <h2 class="h4 mt-5">Lock contention dashboard</h2>
    <p class="text-muted">Currently-held pipeline locks, and historical
      contention - one user's session finding a <code>(repo, CO)</code>
      lock already held by a different user (see
      <code>app/lib/locks/pipelineLock.js</code>).</p>
    <h3 class="h6 mt-3">Currently held</h3>
    <table class="table table-hover align-middle">
      <thead>
        <tr>
          <th>Repo</th>
          <th>CO</th>
          <th>Held by</th>
          <th>Locked at</th>
        </tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody id="active-lock-rows">
        <tr><td colspan="4" class="text-muted">Loading&hellip;</td></tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>
    <h3 class="h6 mt-3">Most-contended COs</h3>
    <table class="table table-hover align-middle">
      <thead>
        <tr>
          <th>Repo</th>
          <th>CO</th>
          <th>Contention count</th>
          <th>Last contended</th>
        </tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody id="lock-contention-rows">
        <tr><td colspan="4" class="text-muted">Loading&hellip;</td></tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </div>
  <script src="/js/api-client.js"></script>
  <script src="/js/dom-utils.js"></script>
  <script src="/js/nav.js"></script>
  <script src="/js/admin.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
